Preserve is the origin of the user-visible failure, and I found no second fault with its own service-level evidence. Route-service's server spans look normal, so its queueing reads as load, not a fault. The answer is below.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-preserve-service",
      "fault_kind": "http_aborted",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT count(*) AS n, sum(CASE WHEN attr_status_code='Error' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS errs FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-preserve-service' AND span_name='POST' AND attr_span_kind='Client'",
          "claim": "All preserve-service client POST calls to travel trip_detail errored: 242 of 242 failed in the abnormal window."
        },
        {
          "kind": "log",
          "sql": "SELECT message, count(*) AS n FROM abnormal_logs WHERE level='SEVERE' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY n DESC LIMIT 5",
          "claim": "Preserve logs SEVERE I/O error on POST to ts-travel-service trip_detail: 'Unexpected end of file from server'; 241 occurrences."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT attr_http_response_status_code, attr_status_code, count(*) AS n, round(avg(duration)/1e6,1) AS avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-travel-service' AND span_name='POST /api/v1/travelservice/trip_detail' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Travel's own trip_detail server spans still report HTTP 200 and Unset status, so the callee's server side looks normal."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-preserve-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT attr_http_response_status_code, attr_status_code, count(*) AS n, round(avg(duration)/1e6,1) AS avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND span_name LIKE '%preserve%' AND attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Dashboard's preserve requests return HTTP 500 with Error status, averaging about 8 seconds, because preserve fails downstream."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

